✅ ✅ ✅ 17. Real Interview Scenarios 🔥

✅ Scenario 1: Build failing after commit
👉 Answer:

Check console logs ✅
Identify failing stage ✅
Fix code / dependency ✅


✅ Scenario 2: Jenkins cannot connect to server
👉 Answer:

Check SSH ✅
validate credentials ✅
check network ✅


✅ Scenario 3: Deployment failed halfway
👉 Answer:

rollback deployment ✅
fix issue ✅
re-trigger pipeline ✅


✅ Scenario 4: Secret exposed in pipeline
👉 Answer:

move to Jenkins credentials ✅
remove hardcoding ✅


✅ Scenario 5: Pipeline slow
👉 Answer:

parallel stages ✅
optimize build ✅


